# The Network: Alibaba CIDR
#
# Expects Domestic.
#
# Alibaba's anycast space, which its apps dial by address with no name the gateway can read. The blocks are registered in the United States, so GEOIP,CN misses them and the flows reached FINAL: in the 12 days to 2026-09-21, 3,993 QUIC handshakes rejected by block-quic and 2,965 flows (340 MB) carried abroad through eight exit nodes in Hong Kong, Taiwan and Japan, from five devices. Taobao then sees one session arriving from a mainland address and from rotating foreign data centers at once, which its risk control answers by restricting the app.
#
# 155.102.0.0/16 and 163.181.0.0/16 are originated by Taobao's own network, AS24429. 47.246.0.0/16 and 139.95.0.0/16 are anycast blocks inside Alibaba Cloud's AS45102 that the same devices dial the same way. The rest of AS45102 is rented cloud capacity in foreign regions and stays out. Place below domain rules. Pair with Platforms/Alibaba.list.

IP-CIDR,155.102.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,163.181.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,47.246.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,139.95.0.0/16,no-resolve
